# Revisions that are pure reformatting - ignore them in git blame.
#
# Requires one of:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs   (per clone)
# GitHub's blame view honours this file automatically.
#
# ce9d165 - chore(format): normalise src and test with prettier (printWidth 100)
# The repo was written to a ~100-column style while .prettierrc left printWidth
# at its 80 default, so the one-time normalisation re-joined lines that had been
# split by hand. Blame skips them with this file; without it, prettier's line
# joins take attribution away from the commits that wrote the code (git blame -w
# does NOT cover a line join - only whitespace within a line).
